# um-texts 1
=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Boots Tiger_Hide
Gipath boots of tiger skin
Anyone who has spent time marching through the woods will appreciate the stealth that fur footwear provides.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Boots Tiger_Hide_White
Snow tiger's fur boots
Your walk will be as soft as a Tiger's in these.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Gloves Tiger_Hide
Gipath gauntlets of tiger skin
Good decoration plus additional protection!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Gloves Tiger_Hide_White
Snow tiger's fur gauntlets
A strong hand in a soft gauntlet is a formidable combination!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Helm Tiger_Hide
Gipath "Tiger Head" helmet
Not suitable for just an average hunter - this is headgear for a leader!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Helm Tiger_Hide_White
"Snow Tiger's head" helmet
Much prettier than a fur hat, and much stronger, too.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Leggins Tiger_Hide
Gipath leggings of tiger skin
Not suitable for just an average hunter - this is a garment for a leader!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Leggins Tiger_Hide_White
Snow tiger fur leggings
Some extra leg protection against both weapons and cold can prove useful.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Pants Tiger_Hide
Gipath trousers of tiger skin
Provide decent protection and are suitable for long marches through the woods.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Pants Tiger_Hide_White
Snow tiger's fur trousers
Provide adequate protection from weapons and cold.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Plate Tiger_Hide
Gipath hunting coat of tiger skin
Not suitable for just an average hunter - this garment is for a leader!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Plate Tiger_Hide_White
Snow tiger fur cloak
Snow Tiger's fur provides perfect camouflage in snow.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Shirt Tiger_Hide
Gipath breastplate of tiger skin
Provides decent protection and looks better than a simple breastplate.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Brigand_Shirt Tiger_Hide_White
Snow tiger's fur breastplate
It is tough, it is beautiful, and most importantly it is warm!

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Boots Tanned_Thin
Gipath stitched boots of hard leather
Now you can risk getting into a fight - but not into combat!

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Boots Thick
Gipath stitched boots of tough leather
Good price/performance ratio.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Boots Thin
Gipath stitched boots of thin leather
They are light and relatively strong.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Gloves Tanned_Thin
Gipath stitched gauntlets of hard leather
Wolf's teeth will no longer present any danger to you - but beware of more dangerous creatures!

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Gloves Thick
Gipath stitched gauntlets of tough leather
Provide decent protection for nearly the entire length of your arms.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Gloves Thin
Gipath stitched gauntlets of thin leather
Provide almost complete protection for your arms, though the material could be better.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Helm Tanned_Thin
Gipath stitched helmet of hard leather
Good head protection. You can get better still, but it shall not be easy.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Helm Thick
Gipath stitched helmet of tough leather
Decent head protection, but by no means universal.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Helm Thin
Gipath stitched helmet of thin leather
Decent head protection, but you should still avoid exposure to the axe!

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Leggins Tanned_Thin
Gipath stitched leggings of hard leather
Good additional leg protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Leggins Thick
Gipath stitched leggings of tough leather
They look good and protect better.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Leggins Thin
Gipath stitched leggings of thin leather
Not the best material, though they would still protect you from the weaker blows.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Pants Tanned_Thin
Gipath long stitched trousers of hard leather
Not very comfortable for walking long distances, but excellent leg protection in combat.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Pants Thick
Gipath long stitched trousers of tough leather
Give your legs adequate protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Pants Thin
Gipath long stitched trousers of thin leather
Protect your legs from top to bottom - as well as you can expect from thin leather.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Plate Tanned_Thin
Gipath stitched coat of hard leather
Worthy protection for your body.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Plate Thick
Gipath stitched coat of tough leather
Good cut, decent material. Sensible choice if your resources are limited.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Plate Thin
Gipath stitched coat of thin leather
Good cut, but rather poor material.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Shirt Tanned_Thin
Gipath stitched breastplate of hard leather
A bit heavy, but provides good protection for your body.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Shirt Thick
Gipath stitched breastplate of tough leather
Provides decent protection for your shoulders and part of your back.

=== ARMOR Gipat_High_Shirt Thin
Gipath stitched breastplate of thin leather
It is not bad, but there's definitely better materials.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Boots Tanned_Thin
Gipath heavy boots of hard leather
The best kind of footwear available in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Boots Thick
Gipath heavy boots of tough leather
Good leg protection. Only hard leather is better in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Boots Thin
Gipath heavy boots of thin leather
This blueprint is for an excellent design but made out of the poorest leather. The price is high and the effectiveness is rather low.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Gloves Tanned_Thin
Gipath heavy gauntlets of hard leather
The best gauntlets you can get in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Gloves Thick
Gipath heavy gauntlets of tough leather
Decent protection for your arms, they are almost full-length.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Gloves Thin
Gipath heavy gauntlets of thin leather
The best type of gauntlets, but made out of the thinnest leather. Not a sensible choice.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Helm Tanned_Thin
Gipath heavy helmet of hard leather
The best kind of this armor you can get in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Helm Thick
Gipath heavy helmet of tough leather
Gives your head decent protection, though not from every weapon.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Helm Thin
Gipath heavy helmet of thin leather
No point in protecting the head which decides to combine this great blueprint with this flimsy material!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Leggins Tanned_Thin
Gipath heavy leggings of hard leather
The best leggings you can get in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Leggins Thick
Gipath heavy leggings of tough leather
Good leg protection. You can only improve it further by using hard leather.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Leggins Thin
Gipath heavy leggings of thin leather
The best blueprint and the worst kind of leather. They look good but provide poor protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Pants Tanned_Thin
Gipath heavy long trousers of hard leather
The best pair of trousers you can get in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Pants Thick
Gipath heavy long trousers of tough leather
Good leg protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Pants Thin
Gipath heavy long trousers of thin leather
The best blueprint and the thinnest leather. Strange choice!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Plate Tanned_Thin
Gipath heavy coat of hard leather
The best coat you can get in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Plate Thick
Gipath heavy coat of tough leather
Good cut, decent material. Sensible choice if your resources are limited.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Plate Thin
Gipath heavy coat of thin leather
A fine coat made out of poor quality leather. A very strange combination  indeed!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Shirt Tanned_Thin
Gipath heavy shirt of hard leather
The best shirt you can get in Gipath.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Shirt Thick
Gipath heavy shirt of tough leather
Good protection for your shoulders and part of your back.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Highest_Shirt Thin
Gipath heavy shirt of thin leather
The best possible blueprint with the worst type of leather. Of course it'll protect you, but you could do much better.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Boots Tanned_Thin
Gipath light boots of hard leather
Decent footwear if you do not have far to go.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Boots Thick
Gipath light boots of tough leather
Quite average footwear. You could do better than that.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Boots Thin
Gipath light boots of thin leather
They are better than going barefoot, but not by much.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Gloves Tanned_Thin
Gipath light gauntlets of hard leather
Now you can risk getting into a fight - but not into combat!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Gloves Thick
Gipath light gauntlets of tough leather
Despite their solid appearance, they still provide more decoration than protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Gloves Thin
Gipath light gauntlets of thin leather
These won't really protect your arms... But at least you will look like a warrior!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Helm Tanned_Thin
Gipath light helmet of hard leather
Now you can risk getting into a fight - but not into combat!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Helm Thick
Gipath light helmet of tough leather
It will protect you from a pine cone falling on your head, but not from a stone…

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Helm Thin
Gipath light helmet of thin leather
More decoration than protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Leggins Tanned_Thin
Gipath light leggings of hard leather
Maybe they will save you from a wolf's teeth ... But, sadly, not from a blade or an axe.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Leggins Thick
Gipath light leggings of tough leather
Cannot say they are totally useless. But you will not get much use out of them!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Leggins Thin
Gipath light leggings of thin leather
They save your knees and feet from accidental scratches and bruises, but not from weapons!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Pants Tanned_Thin
Gipath light trousers of hard leather
The hard leather is good, but it would be better still if these leggings were a bit longer!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Pants Thick
Gipath light trousers of tough leather
Provide some protection; every little bit helps when such a valuable body part is at stake...

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Pants Thin
Gipath light trousers of thin leather
Flimsy protection, especially for such a valuable body part...

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Plate Tanned_Thin
Gipath light shirt of hard leather
Maybe it will save you from a wolf's teeth ... but, sadly, not from a blade or an axe.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Plate Thick
Gipath light shirt of tough leather
It will cover what your breastplate leaves unprotected. But it leaves a bit to be desired…

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Plate Thin
Gipath light shirt of thin leather
Not the best option, but sufficient if you do not have anything else.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Shirt Tanned_Thin
Gipath light breastplate of hard leather
A piece of hard leather covering upper body, it provides good protection from light weapons.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Shirt Thick
Gipath light breastplate of tough leather
A piece of tough leather covering part of your upper body, it provides some protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Low_Shirt Thin
Gipath light breastplate of thin leather
A piece of thin leather covering part of your upper body... it may even protect you from the sun's rays.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Boots Tanned_Thin
Gipath simple boots of hard leather
The best leather boots possible.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Boots Thick
Gipath simple boots of tough leather
Simple and comfortable. And not very expensive, either.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Boots Thin
Gipath simple boots of thin leather
Not very protective - but you cannot expect much for that sort of price, can you?

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Gloves Tanned_Thin
Gipath simple gauntlets of hard leather
Decent protection for the part of your arm which it covers. Unfortunately, most of your arm remains bare!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Gloves Thick
Gipath simple gauntlets of tough leather
They can protect part of your arm from accidental scratches and cuts.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Gloves Thin
Gipath simple gauntlets of thin leather
They look good, but are not very useful for protection.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Helm Tanned_Thin
Gipath simple helmet of hard leather
Such a helmet will save your head from the first strike, but not the second one …

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Helm Thick
Gipath simple helmet of tough leather
It will protect you from a pine cone falling on your head, but not from a stone…

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Helm Thin
Gipath simple helmet of thin leather
It is better than nothing, but not by much.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Leggins Tanned_Thin
Gipath simple leggings of hard leather
Provides decent protection for your legs, but with that sort of material other designs may be better.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Leggins Thick
Gipath simple leggings of tough leather
Give added protection to your legs, though better is available.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Leggins Thin
Gipath simple leggings of thin leather
They will protect your legs from splinters and thorns ... what else could you expect for that price?

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Pants Tanned_Thin
Gipath simple shorts of hard leather
Provide decent protection for the part of the leg they cover. Unfortunately, most of your leg remains bare!

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Pants Thick
Gipath simple shorts of tough leather
Nothing special. Just pants, really, except they are a bit tougher than the ones made of thin leather.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Pants Thin
Gipath simple shorts of thin leather
These are nothing special. Not a lot of protection, for not a lot of money.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Plate Tanned_Thin
Gipath simple coat of hard leather
Decent protection from a wolf's teeth and a boar's fangs, but it may not stand up against sharp weapons.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Plate Thick
Gipath simple coat of tough leather
Now you can risk venturing into a forest. (providing, of course, you do not go too far).

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Plate Thin
Gipath simple coat of thin leather
A strange mix of design and material. Only very poor people would think of making such things.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Shirt Tanned_Thin
Gipath simple breastplate of hard leather
Decent price/performance ratio.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Shirt Thick
Gipath simple breastplate of tough leather
It is not bad, but certainly better is available.

=== ARMOR Gipat_Medium_Shirt Thin
Gipath simple breastplate of thin leather
Here is a garment for these who do not anticipate very dangerous encounters.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Boots Tanned_Thin
Khadaganian hard leather leggings
Very good for long marches.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Boots Thick
Khadaganian tough leather leggings
Good enough for hunters, but not for warriors.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Boots Thin
Khadaganian thin leather leggings
Not strong, but light.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Gloves Tanned_Thin
Khadaganian hard leather gauntlets
Enough to turn a wolf's fangs, most likely.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Gloves Thick
Khadaganian tough leather gauntlets
These will protect your hands from thorns - and maybe even from wolf's teeth.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Gloves Thin
Khadaganian thin leather gauntlets
Good enough for a fist fight at a village festival.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Helm Tanned_Thin
Khadaganian hard leather helmet
This may save you from a blow to the head.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Helm Thick
Khadaganian tough leather helmet
Provides certain protection, but do not rely on it too much in combat.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Helm Thin
Khadaganian thin leather helmet
This will protect your head from a falling pine cone - but not from a good blow.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Leggins Tanned_Thin
Khadaganian hard leather top leggings
Do not kick a sleeping Tiger when you are wearing only these…

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Leggins Thick
Khadaganian tough leather top leggings
Would come in handy for a walk in thorny vegetation.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Leggins Thin
Khadaganian thin leather top leggings
Almost completely useless in combat.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Pants Tanned_Thin
Khadaganian hard leather trousers
Provide some protection, but not sufficient for serious combat.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Pants Thick
Khadaganian tough leather trousers
These will save you from a spider's bite... But not from much more.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Pants Thin
Khadaganian thin leather trousers
Almost no protection at all, at least they're comfortable.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Plate Tanned_Thin
Khadaganian hard leather coat
Provides decent protection against wild beasts.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Plate Thick
Khadaganian tough leather coat
Good for travel - if you are not expecting to face enemies.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Plate Thin
Khadaganian thin leather coat
Thin and flimsy - but light.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Shirt Tanned_Thin
Khadaganian lower breastplate of hard leather
This is some good protective equipment.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Shirt Thick
Khadaganian lower breastplate of tough leather
Stronger than thin leather. Good enough for hunting.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_Brigand_Shirt Thin
Khadaganian lower breastplate of thin leather
Thin leather is not the best possible protection for a warrior.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Boots Adamantium
Khadaganian adamantite laminar boots
Protect your feet from almost any blow.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Boots Bronze
Khadaganian bronze laminar boots
Use better material, and they will be perfect!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Boots Iron
Khadaganian iron laminar boots
Good protection, but not the best possible.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Boots Meteoric
Khadaganian meteorite laminar boots
Together with the leggings, these make perfect protection for feet and legs!!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Boots Mithrill
Khadaganian mithrill laminar boots
Worth any price!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Boots Steel
Khadaganian steel laminar boots
Together with the leggings, these provide excellent protection for legs and feet.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Gloves Adamantium
Khadaganian adamantite laminar gauntlets
Only meteorite gauntlets are better!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Gloves Bronze
Khadaganian bronze laminar gauntlets
Bronze is too soft and heavy to protect well.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Gloves Iron
Khadaganian iron laminar gauntlets
Such high-class armor should be made of better metals.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Gloves Meteoric
Khadaganian meteorite laminar gauntlets
These can easily fend off a sword blow!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Gloves Mithrill
Khadaganian mithrill laminar gauntlets
Mithrill's lightness and flexibility make it perfect armor material!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Gloves Steel
Khadaganian steel laminar gauntlets
Serious protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Helm Adamantium
Khadaganian forged adamantite helmet
It is pretty, it is strong... and expensive.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Helm Bronze
Khadaganian forged bronze helmet
Perfectly made! If only there were better metal available…

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Helm Iron
Khadaganian forged iron helmet
You should add decent material to the smith's good work.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Helm Meteoric
Khadaganian forged meteorite helmet
The worst which can happen to your head now is a concussion!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Helm Mithrill
Khadaganian forged mithrill helmet
Few weapons can pierce this helmet.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Helm Steel
Khadaganian steel forged helmet
Very good head protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Leggins Adamantium
Khadaganian forged adamantite top leggings
Probably the best leggings.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Leggins Bronze
Khadaganian forged bronze top leggings
Good work - but cheap material …

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Leggins Iron
Khadaganian forged iron top leggings
Good extra leg protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Leggins Meteoric
Khadaganian forged meteorite top leggings
A perfect mix of metal and design!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Leggins Mithrill
Khadaganian forged mithrill top leggings
Good price/quality ratio.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Leggins Steel
Khadaganian forged steel top leggings
Very good additional leg protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Pants Adamantium
Khadaganian adamantite laminar trousers
A silly Tiger would simply break its teeth on these.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Pants Bronze
Khadaganian bronze laminar trousers
Will not last long in combat...

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Pants Iron
Khadaganian iron laminar trousers
Good leg protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Pants Meteoric
Khadaganian meteorite laminar trousers
The very best!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Pants Mithrill
Khadaganian mithrill laminar trousers
They are light - but not to make running away from the enemy easier!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Pants Steel
Khadaganian steel laminar trousers
These would serve an experienced warrior well.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Plate Adamantium
Khadaganian forged adamantite cuirass
You can rely on this in the heat of battle!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Plate Bronze
Khadaganian forged bronze cuirass
Why carry heavy and inefficient armor?

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Plate Iron
Khadaganian forged iron cuirass
Decent body and arm protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Plate Meteoric
Khadaganian forged meteorite cuirass
It is almost impossible to find anything better!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Plate Mithrill
Khadaganian forged mithrill cuirass
Good protection is worth any price.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Plate Steel
Khadaganian forged steel cuirass
Very serious protection for a skilled fighter.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Shirt Adamantium
Khadaganian light adamantite body armor
Adamantite is very expensive, but it is worth it!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Shirt Bronze
Khadaganian light bronze body armor
Too heavy and uncomfortable.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Shirt Iron
Khadaganian light iron body armor
Better than bronze, but there's better yet available…

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Shirt Meteoric
Khadaganian light meteorite body armor
You can find even better, but it will cost an awful lot!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Shirt Mithrill
Khadaganian light mithrill body armor
Not very cheap, but one of the strongest.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High2_Shirt Steel
Khadaganian light steel body armor
No way to pierce this with a chance arrow.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Boots Dragon_Black
Khadaganian boots of Blue Dragon hide
You can only improve these if you reinforce them with metal!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Boots Dragon_Green
Khadaganian boots of Green Dragon hide
Comfortable and strong!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Boots Dragon_Red
Khadaganian boots of Red Dragon hide
You can walk on burning coals in these!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Boots Troll_Black
Khadaganian boots of black Troll hide
Only Dragon hide boots are better!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Boots Troll_Blue
Khadaganian boots of blue Troll hide
You can walk safely in these!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Boots Troll_Green
Khadaganian boots of green Troll hide
These will protect your feet, and not just from swamp mud!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Gloves Dragon_Black
Khadaganian gauntlets of Blue Dragon hide
The best of light gauntlets!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Gloves Dragon_Green
Khadaganian gauntlets of Green Dragon hide
You can rely on them in combat!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Gloves Dragon_Red
Khadaganian gauntlets of Red Dragon hide
Dragon hide provides the maximum protection any leather can offer.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Gloves Troll_Black
Khadaganian gauntlets of black Troll hide
Good protection from poor weapons.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Gloves Troll_Blue
Khadaganian gauntlets of blue Troll hide
Provide decent protection in combat.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Gloves Troll_Green
Khadaganian gauntlets of green Troll hide
Good equipment, and not just for a fistfight at a village fair!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Helm Adamantium
Khadaganian light adamantite helmet
Not the best possible design for this material!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Helm Bronze
Khadaganian light bronze helmet
You wouldn't call it light after a couple of hours!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Helm Iron
Khadaganian light iron helmet
Soft cloth hides tough metal...

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Helm Meteoric
Khadaganian light meteorite helmet
It is a waste, really - to use meteorite iron like that!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Helm Mithrill
Khadaganian light mithrill helmet
It is light, it is pretty, and it's strong!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Helm Steel
Khadaganian light steel helmet
Not too expensive, but provides decent protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Leggins Adamantium
Khadaganian adamantite chainmail trousers
This metal is too expensive to use it for such simple armor.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Leggins Bronze
Khadaganian bronze chainmail trousers
Bronze onlays provide additional protection - and weight...

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Leggins Iron
Khadaganian iron chainmail trousers
They are reinforced with metal and protect the wearer from blows from simple weapons.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Leggins Meteoric
Khadaganian meteorite chainmail trousers
Meteorite iron is too good for this design!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Leggins Mithrill
Khadaganian mithrill chainmail trousers
These are really light - and provide good protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Leggins Steel
Khadaganian steel chainmail trousers
These ensure freedom of movement and provide decent protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Pants Dragon_Black
Khadaganian trousers of Blue Dragon hide
Probably the best leather trousers.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Pants Dragon_Green
Khadaganian trousers of Green Dragon hide
Strong and light - a good choice!

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Pants Dragon_Red
Khadaganian trousers of Red Dragon hide
A good mix of comfort and protection.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Pants Troll_Black
Khadaganian trousers of black Troll hide
Reliable, and they ensure freedom of movement, too.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Pants Troll_Blue
Khadaganian trousers of blue Troll hide
Good protection from poor weapons.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Pants Troll_Green
Khadaganian trousers of green Troll hide
Not a bad pair of pants.

=== ARMOR Hadagan_High_Plate Adamantium
Khadaganian light adamantite cuirass
